    <item>
      <title>Rafael Martínez García Peña </title>
      <link>https://prisma.groningen/about/rafael/</link>
      <pubDate>Fri, 27 Jun 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>https://prisma.groningen/about/rafael/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Hi all! I&amp;rsquo;m Rafael, I do computer vision :)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I specialize in data science, particularly when it comes to unstructured data like images and video. My specialty is in using machine- and deep-learning for classification. I&amp;rsquo;ve done some work in face recognition, moleculary dynamics, and medicine. Currently, I&amp;rsquo;m the PhD in charge of the Filming NEMO project (see below).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I also manage this webpage! If something breaks, &lt;strong&gt;panic!!&lt;/strong&gt; (and send me an email)&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      <media:content xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://prisma.groningen/about/rafael/featuredrafael.png" />
